# RPCS3 reference scene dungeon_door (tests/rpcs3_reference.py): the first dungeon, the lamp-lit second room south door,
# standing, the camera at (89.6, -104.0) as RPCS3 had it; the character preset two rows down (the Assassin). Its
# frame is described and its targets dumped at the trigger. From the RPCS3 comparison, 2026-11-07/09.
include common.drive
include dungeon1_route.drive
log TitleMovie 120
sleep 5
press START
sleep 3
press START
sleep 5
press UP                    # "Change characters?" YES
sleep 1
press CROSS
sleep 6
press DOWN
sleep 1
press DOWN
sleep 1
shot chosen
press CROSS
sleep 3
shot after-select
press CROSS
sleep 8
shot in-game
state area==37,life>0 90
sleep 3
call dungeon_entry
goto 89.4 -114.3 0.5 10 soft
sleep 5
shot door
touch describe.trigger
sleep 2
shot described
